      "rationale": "The span explicitly identifies staff awareness of review as a possible influence on attachment rates."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C033.signal_basis",
    "value": "Missing-attachment frequency decreases after responsibility becomes explicit across comparable observation periods. This response can also reflect staff awareness of review; temporal association does not exclude alternative causes.",
    "scope": "Prospective attachment-rate comparisons using comparable covered orders and consistent inspection intervals; no attribution of an observed change specifically to awareness.",
